// The node view (`cadrs_app::node_view`): the feature list as a node graph, with a
// configuration. `blocks 2`: two blocks, each a sketch and a New extrude.
// 01 The node view: a panel under the 3D view (the feature list staying on the left), a canvas
//    with the schematic's grid; each feature a node (an extrude's node its dialog, its title
//    its icon, type and name), geometry traces from sketches into extrudes, each node's output
//    row, and the Parts node on the right. Create (top left), Auto arrange and Fit (top right).
// 02 Create ▸ Input Configuration, named `size`, [+] twice, + Output named `bolt_size` with
//    3, 4 and 5 mm: an Input Configuration node "size", its configurations default, config2 and
//    config3 as columns (default highlighted), its output a row with a socket on the right;
//    + Output again: a second length output `output` under it.
// 03 bolt_size's socket dragged onto Extrude 1's Depth: Depth reads #bolt_size, a trace from
//    the output to the field.
// 04 The wire dragged off Extrude 1's Depth onto Extrude 2's: Extrude 2 reads #bolt_size,
//    Extrude 1 its value again (one undo step).
// 05 A click on Extrude 2's body: its live dialog in its node (✓ and ✕ in the node's header).
// 06 config3's heading clicked: config3 highlighted and shown (the features header says so),
//    Extrude 2 5 mm deep.
// 07 The Configuration panel (the tab bar's button): on the right, full height (beside the 3D
//    view and the node panel), the size table one row per configuration.
// 07b Its left edge dragged 200 px left: the panel wider, the 3D view and node panel narrower.
// 08 Auto arrange: laid out again and framed.
// 09 The node view closed: the 3D view full height again, the List's dropdown in the list.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("blocks 2"),
        Click(ui("feature-node-view")),
        WaitFor("node-canvas"),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("01-node-view"),
        Click(ui("node-canvas-create")),
        WaitFor("node-create-input-configuration"),
        Click(ui("node-create-input-configuration")),
        WaitFor("node-config-title-edit"),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("size"),
        Key("Enter"),
        WaitFor("node-config-size"),
        Click(ui("node-config-size-add-row")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("node-config-size-add-row")),
        WaitFor("node-config-size-show-3"),
        Click(ui("node-config-size-add-output")),
        WaitFor("node-output-output-name"),
        Click(ui("node-output-output-name")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("bolt_size"),
        Key("Enter"),
        WaitFor("node-output-bolt_size-1"),
        Click(ui("node-output-bolt_size-1")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("3 mm"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("node-output-bolt_size-2")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("4 mm"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("node-output-bolt_size-3")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("5 mm"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(20),
        ExpectText("node-config-size", "5 mm"),
        Click(ui("node-config-size-add-output")),
        WaitFor("node-output-output-name"),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("02-input"),
        Drag(ui("node-output-bolt_size-out"), ui("node-extrude-1-depth")),
        ExpectText("node-extrude-1", "#bolt_size"),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("03-wired"),
        Drag(ui("node-extrude-1-depth"), ui("node-extrude-2-depth")),
        ExpectText("node-extrude-2", "#bolt_size"),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("04-rewired"),
        Click(ui("node-extrude-2-body")),
        Wait(30),
        Screenshot("05-live"),
        Key("Escape"),
        Wait(20),
        Click(ui("node-config-size-show-3")),
        Wait(10),
        ExpectText("feature-preset", "config3"),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("06-shown"),
        Click(ui("panel-configuration")),
        WaitFor("configuration-panel"),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("07-table"),
        Drag(ui_at("configuration-panel-edge", 0.5, 0.5), ui_at("configuration-scroll", 0.295, 0.421)),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("07b-wider"),
        Click(ui("node-canvas-arrange")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("08-arranged"),
        Click(ui("feature-node-view")),
        Wait(20),
        ExpectText("feature-preset", "config3"),
        Screenshot("09-list"),
    ],
)
